n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kr131Y4C1G4Q7kNvwGWcsnZ&_nc_oc=AdqO68DKysuy1QG88-AtUZUWk46b6oc6O3hABajPnCMm-s4Xyej5ONayqtIAWEmjOzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTqBgHg0BdevOx4UmKhxXVmCyojrgqswtEvW2qHLYujEw&oe=6AF49B12"}, {"file_name": "start_en.png", "id": "1064852092992591", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623185_1064852096325924_5256801266472898694_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nW099STiMbAQ7kNvwGYaCDX&_nc_oc=AdrjG3Q4v-aiI-tzzSzAsrc12fA0rnOAObYce-tS1LgTh4rzvnOXdiG9a24nm6hjwK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGKzkbp6DTik2KMaUuCVh2ZmqPJ-obWYa4nOq-5m569g&oe=6AF480CC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "pices_3_en - \u30b3\u30d4\u30fc.png", "id": "2192036448390655", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_2192036451723988_6318204505656794810_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZyvHAJuXzHAQ7kNvwF1xG66&_nc_oc=AdqKufvSnGnk7vVGQOVJQzHpnMJuqGNI9RzEXOFyfXW2C0fZzxrODh_4Rh6QJ4pk-0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgXQMxmM1xMddr5SJ7r_eGfS4BSmoK4SX8p7xbHBfciA&oe=6AF47B67"}, "display_name": "Deep Sky Jigsaw VR", "keywords": ["VRPuzzle", "JigsawPuzzle", "Astronomy", "Constellations", "SpaceGame"], "long_description": "# Deep Sky Jigsaw VR\n\n**Spin the pieces, twist them around, and slam them back into the galaxy!**\n\n**Deep Sky Jigsaw VR** turns the night sky into a giant 3D jigsaw puzzle for Meta Quest.\n\nLook up and you\u2019ll see constellations, the Milky Way, nebulae, galaxies, and countless stars across the celestial sphere.\n\nThe entire celestial sphere breaks apart into uniquely shaped \u201csky pieces,\u201d each based on real constellation regions, and the pieces fall down around you.\n\nGrab a piece with your controller and rotate it.\n\n**Spin it. Twist it. Flip it around.**\n\nUse stars, constellation lines, the Milky Way, nebulae, and galaxies as clues to find where each piece belongs.\n\nThe correct location is only part of the challenge\u2014the angle and orientation must also match.\n\nLook up. Compare. Rotate.\n\nThen\u2014\n\n**slam it back into the galaxy!**\n\nUnlike a standard jigsaw puzzle, each piece has a unique shape based on the real structure of the night sky.\n\nBefore starting, you can choose which astronomy layers to display, including constellation lines, wide-field nebulae, and the Milky Way.\n\nUse more clues for a relaxed game, or reduce the hints for a greater challenge.\n\nEach time a piece returns to its correct place, the broken sky becomes whole again.\n\nWhen the final piece clicks into position, the complete night sky spreads out above you.\n\nWhether you know the constellations or are just starting to explore the stars:\n\n**Grab it. Rotate it. Fit it back into place.  \nComplete the universe with your own hands.**", "short_description": "Deep Sky Jigsaw VR\n\nSpin the pieces, twist them around, and slam them back into the galaxy!\n\nDeep Sky Jigsaw VR turns the night sky into a giant 3D jigsaw puzzle for Meta Quest.\n\nGrab sky pieces based on real constellation regions, rotate them, and find where they belong.\n\nUse stars, constellation lines, the Milky Way, nebulae, and galaxies as clues.\n\nRestore the missing pieces and complete the night sky.\n\nGrab it. Rotate it. Fit it back into place. Complete the universe!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jun1wata.wordpress.com/2019/04/24/spectraview-privacy-policy_/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "jun1wata", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://jun1wata.wordpress.com/category/deep-sky-finder/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": 